---
import { rawFieldGroups } from "../data/r-machine-learning";
---

<figure class="field-schema" aria-labelledby="field-schema-title">
  <figcaption>
    <span>25 FIELDS</span>
    <div>
      <h3 id="field-schema-title">原始数据不是一张“变量清单”，而是八类信息的组合</h3>
      <p>
        字段先按其在客户观察中的角色重新排列。标识和结果来源不会作为输入；其余字段分别描述客户、计划、使用、服务、数字互动与体验。
      </p>
    </div>
  </figcaption>
  <div class="field-schema__grid">
    {
      rawFieldGroups.map((group) => (
        <section data-tone={group.tone}>
          <header>
            <strong>{group.group}</strong>
            <span>{group.fields.length}</span>
          </header>
          <ul>
            {group.fields.map((field) => (
              <li>
                <code>{field}</code>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </section>
      ))
    }
  </div>
  <p class="field-schema__reading">
    应该看哪里：25 个字段中只有一个记录标识和一个结果来源，其余 23
    个字段跨越多个业务维度。最终七变量并非把同类字段全部留下，而是经过总体限定、应答质量、相关性和解释目标逐步缩减。
  </p>
</figure>

<style>
  .field-schema {
    margin: 0;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  figcaption {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: start;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  figcaption > span {
    padding: 0.5rem 0.7rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--colour-border);
    border-radius: 999px;
    color: var(--colour-primary-strong);
    font: 700 0.7rem/1 var(--font-mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  h3,
  p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  h3 {
    max-width: 28ch;
    font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 3vw, 2.25rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
  }

  figcaption p,
  .field-schema__reading {
    max-width: 72ch;
    margin-top: 0.65rem;
    color: var(--colour-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.72;
  }

  .field-schema__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--colour-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: var(--colour-border);
  }

  section {
    min-width: 0;
    padding: 1rem;
    background: var(--colour-surface);
  }

  section header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.75rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--schema-tone, var(--colour-primary));
  }

  section[data-tone="target"] {
    --schema-tone: var(--colour-accent);
  }
  section[data-tone="commercial"] {
    --schema-tone: var(--colour-primary-strong);
  }
  section[data-tone="usage"] {
    --schema-tone: var(--colour-secondary);
  }
  section[data-tone="service"] {
    --schema-tone: var(--colour-warning, #9b6b38);
  }
  section[data-tone="digital"] {
    --schema-tone: var(--colour-info, #557f91);
  }

  header span {
    color: var(--colour-text-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }

  ul {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.55rem;
    margin: 0.85rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  code {
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    color: var(--colour-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.76rem;
  }

  .field-schema__reading {
    padding-left: 1rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--colour-accent);
  }

  @media (max-width: 920px) {
    .field-schema__grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    figcaption {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    figcaption > span {
      width: max-content;
    }
    .field-schema__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
